# Instance settings and key management errors
E29000 = These settings were changed by someone else. Reload them and try again.
E29001 = The value must be between { $min } and { $max }.
E29002 = The client mutation ID must be at most { $max } characters.
E29003 = The instance settings could not be saved.
E29004 = The key does not exist.
E29005 = Only a key that is currently in use can be rotated.
E29006 = This is the only key in use for its purpose. Add or rotate another key before revoking it.
E29007 = The key has already been revoked.
E29008 = The { $algorithm } algorithm cannot use this key type.
